---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service — HaikaiTech" description="Terms of Service for HaikaiTech Solutions.">
  <main class="min-h-screen font-sans bg-paper bg-grid-pattern">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 transition-colors mb-8 inline-block">&larr; Back to home</a>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: July 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-600 space-y-6">
        <p>These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern the provision of freelance software engineering and web development services by HaikaiTech Solutions ("we", "our", "us") to you ("Client"). By engaging our services, you agree to these Terms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">1. Services</h2>
        <p>We provide custom software development, web application development, dashboard development, interactive visualisation, and related technical consulting services. The specific scope, deliverables, timeline, and fees for each project will be outlined in a separate project proposal or Statement of Work ("SOW") agreed upon by both parties.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">2. Payment Terms</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>Project fees are structured as milestone-based payments as specified in the SOW.</li>
          <li>A deposit may be required before work begins, as specified in the SOW.</li>
          <li>Invoices are due within 14 days of receipt unless otherwise agreed.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Deliverables:</strong> Upon full payment, the Client receives full ownership of the custom code, designs, and deliverables created specifically for the project.</li>
          <li><strong>Pre-existing materials:</strong> We retain ownership of any pre-existing code, libraries, frameworks, or tools used in the project. We grant the Client a perpetual, non-exclusive license to use these as part of the delivered work.</li>
          <li><strong>Portfolio right:</strong> We reserve the right to display the completed project in our portfolio and on our website unless a non-disclosure agreement explicitly prohibits it.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">4. Client Responsibilities</h2>
        <p>The Client agrees to: (a) provide timely feedback and approvals; (b) provide access to necessary systems, content, and third-party accounts; (c) make milestone payments on schedule. Delays caused by the Client may extend the project timeline.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the maximum extent permitted by Malaysian law, our total liability for any claim arising from our services is limited to the total fees paid by the Client for the specific project giving rise to the claim. We are not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages, including loss of profits or data.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">6. Termination</h2>
        <p>Either party may terminate a project with 14 days' written notice. In the event of termination, the Client shall pay for all work completed up to the termination date. Any deliverables produced up to that point will be transferred to the Client upon payment.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">7. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of Malaysia. Any disputes shall first be attempted to be resolved through good-faith negotiation, and if unresolved, through mediation in Penang, Malaysia.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-8">8. Contact</h2>
        <p>HaikaiTech Solutions<br>Email: <a href="mailto:hq@haikaitech.my" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">hq@haikaitech.my</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
